      "portrait_expression": "startled_remembering",
      "setting_description": "Fragment and Echo",
      "prompt": "I found a broken lantern. Lighthouse, probably. I touched it and something caught in my throat. 'Someone I once knew would have fixed this. Just like that...illumination.' I laughed. And then I asked: What was his name?",
